  <article class="policy-content">
    <div class="policy-intro"><strong>Your privacy matters to Powerix.</strong> This Privacy Policy explains how Powerix Energy Solutions Pvt. Ltd. collects, uses, stores, and protects information obtained from users of our website and services. By accessing or using our platform, you agree to the practices described in this document.</div>

    <section class="policy-section" id="s1">
      <div class="section-header"><div class="section-num">01</div><span class="section-icon">📋</span><h2>Introduction</h2></div>
      <p>Powerix is a renewable energy services company operating in India, specializing in Power Purchase Agreements, grid approvals, transaction management, regulatory compliance, and carbon credit advisory services.</p>
      <p>This Privacy Policy applies to all information collected through our website (<strong>www.powerix.in</strong>), mobile applications, and any related services, sales, marketing, or events.</p>
    </section>
    <hr class="section-divider"/>

    <section class="policy-section" id="s2">
