          <tr><td>Technical Data</td><td>IP address, browser type, pages visited</td><td>Automatically via cookies</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Communication Data</td><td>Emails, chat transcripts, call records</td><td>Direct communication with our team</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Financial Data</td><td>Bank details, invoice records</td><td>Transaction management services</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <hr class="section-divider"/>

    <section class="policy-section" id="s3">
      <div class="section-header"><div class="section-num">03</div><span class="section-icon">⚙️</span><h2>How We Use Your Information</h2></div>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service Delivery:</strong> To provide and manage our renewable energy services including PPA structuring, approval support, and carbon credit advisory.</li>
        <li><strong>Communication:</strong> To respond to enquiries, send service updates, and consultation confirmations.</li>
        <li><strong>Compliance:</strong> To meet legal and regulatory obligations under Indian laws including the IT Act, 2000.</li>
        <li><strong>Improvement:</strong> To analyse usage patterns and improve our website and service offerings.</li>
        <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> To send promotional materials — only with your explicit consent.</li>
        <li><strong>Security:</strong> To detect, investigate, and prevent fraudulent transactions.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <hr class="section-divider"/>

    <section class="policy-section" id="s4">
      <div class="section-header"><div class="section-num">04</div><span class="section-icon">🤝</span><h2>Sharing of Information</h2></div>
      <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information only in these limited circumstances:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Regulatory Authorities:</strong> Government bodies, electricity regulatory commissions (CERC, SERCs), and grid operators.</li>
        <li><strong>Service Partners:</strong> Third-party auditors, verification agencies, and carbon registry bodies.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Obligations:</strong> When required by law, court order, or government authority.</li>
        <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In the event of a merger, acquisition, or asset sale.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <hr class="section-divider"/>

    <section class="policy-section" id="s5">
      <div class="section-header"><div class="section-num">05</div><span class="section-icon">🍪</span><h2>Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies</h2></div>
      <p>Our website uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to improve your browsing experience. We use essential, analytics, preference, and marketing cookies. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>
    </section>
    <hr class="section-divider"/>

    <section class="policy-section" id="s6">
      <div class="section-header"><div class="section-num">06</div><span class="section-icon">🔒</span><h2>Data Security</h2></div>
      <ul>
        <li>SSL/TLS encryption for all data transmitted through our website</li>
        <li>Restricted access to personal data on a need-to-know basis</li>
        <li>Regular security audits and vulnerability assessments</li>
        <li>Secure cloud infrastructure with access controls and audit logs</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="info-box"><strong>Important:</strong> No method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure. If you believe your interaction is no longer secure, contact us immediately at <strong>privacy@powerix.in</strong>.</div>
    </section>
