        <li><strong>Enquiry / Contact Data:</strong> Retained for 2 years from date of last interaction.</li>
        <li><strong>Website Analytics:</strong> Identifiable data deleted after 26 months.</li>
        <li><strong>Marketing Preferences:</strong> Retained until you withdraw consent.</li>
      </ul>
